    {
      "id": "higher_math_2nd-ch7-mcq-001",
      "text": "\\(\\tan^{-1}x + \\tan^{-1}y = \\) কত? যখন \\((xy > 1)\\)",
      "text_en": null,
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "a",
          "text": "\\(\\tan^{-1}\\dfrac{x + y}{1 - xy}\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "b",
          "text": "\\(\\tan^{-1}\\dfrac{x + y}{1 - xy} - \\pi\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "c",
          "text": "\\(\\tan^{-1}\\dfrac{x + y}{1 - xy} + \\pi\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "d",
          "text": "\\(\\tan^{-1}\\dfrac{x + y}{1 - xy} + \\dfrac{\\pi}{2}\\)",
          "image": null
        }
      ],
      "answer": "c",
      "answer_source": "printed",
      "explanation": "\\(xy>1\\) এবং \\(x,y>0\\) হলে \\(\\tan^{-1}x+\\tan^{-1}y=\\pi+\\tan^{-1}\\dfrac{x+y}{1-xy}\\) (সূত্র অনুযায়ী)।",
      "source": {
        "board": "BB",
        "year": "2023",
        "qno": 7,
        "session": null
      },
      "tags": [],
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "higher_math_2nd-ch7-mcq-002",
      "text": "\\(\\cos^{-1}\\left\\{\\cos\\left(-\\dfrac{\\pi}{3}\\right)\\right\\} = \\) কত?",
      "text_en": null,
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "a",
          "text": "\\(-\\dfrac{\\pi}{3}\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "b",
          "text": "\\(\\dfrac{\\pi}{3}\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "c",
          "text": "\\(\\dfrac{2\\pi}{3}\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "d",
          "text": "\\(-\\dfrac{2\\pi}{3}\\)",
          "image": null
        }
      ],
      "answer": "b",
      "answer_source": "printed",
      "explanation": "\\(\\cos\\left(-\\dfrac{\\pi}{3}\\right)=\\cos\\dfrac{\\pi}{3}\\) এবং \\(\\dfrac{\\pi}{3}\\in[0,\\pi]\\) (মুখ্য মানের পরিসর), তাই মান \\(\\dfrac{\\pi}{3}\\)।",
      "source": {
        "board": "BB",
        "year": "2023",
        "qno": 20,
        "session": null
      },
      "tags": [],
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "higher_math_2nd-ch7-mcq-003",
      "text": "বিপরীত বৃত্তীয় ফাংশনের ক্ষেত্রে—",
      "text_en": null,
      "image": null,
      "statements": [
        {
          "label": "i",
          "text": "\\(\\sin^{-1}(-x) = -\\sin^{-1}x\\ \\ (-1 \\le x \\le 1)\\)"
        },
        {
          "label": "ii",
          "text": "\\(\\sin^{-1}\\left(\\sin\\dfrac{3\\pi}{4}\\right) = \\dfrac{3\\pi}{4}\\)"
        },
        {
          "label": "iii",
          "text": "\\(\\sec^{-1}(-x) = \\pi - \\sec^{-1}x\\ \\ (|x| \\ge 1)\\)"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "a",
          "text": "i ও ii",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "b",
          "text": "i ও iii",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "c",
          "text": "ii ও iii",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "d",
          "text": "i, ii ও iii",
          "image": null
        }
      ],
      "answer": "b",
      "answer_source": "printed",
      "explanation": "i: \\(\\sin^{-1}(-x)=-\\sin^{-1}x\\), সত্য।\nii: \\(\\sin^{-1}\\left(\\sin\\dfrac{3\\pi}{4}\\right)=\\sin^{-1}\\left(\\sin\\dfrac{\\pi}{4}\\right)=\\dfrac{\\pi}{4}\\) (কারণ \\(\\dfrac{3\\pi}{4}\\) মুখ্য পরিসর \\(\\left[-\\dfrac{\\pi}{2},\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}\\right]\\) এর বাইরে), মিথ্যা।\niii: \\(\\sec^{-1}(-x)=\\pi-\\sec^{-1}x\\), সত্য।",
      "source": {
        "board": "BB",
        "year": "2023",
        "qno": 21,
        "session": null
      },
      "tags": [],
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "higher_math_2nd-ch7-mcq-004",
      "text": "\\(\\sin\\theta = \\sin\\alpha\\) হলে θ এর মান কত? (যেখানে α একটি ধ্রুবক কোণ)",
      "text_en": null,
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "a",
          "text": "\\(n\\pi + (-1)^n\\alpha,\\ n \\in \\mathbb{Z}\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "b",
          "text": "\\(n\\pi \\pm (-1)^n\\alpha,\\ n \\in \\mathbb{Z}\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "c",
          "text": "\\(n\\pi \\pm \\alpha,\\ n \\in \\mathbb{Z}\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "d",
          "text": "\\(n\\pi - (-1)^n\\alpha,\\ n \\in \\mathbb{Z}\\)",
          "image": null
        }
      ],
      "answer": "a",
      "answer_source": "printed",
      "explanation": "\\(\\sin\\theta=\\sin\\alpha\\) এর সাধারণ সমাধান \\(\\theta=n\\pi+(-1)^n\\alpha,\\ n\\in\\mathbb Z\\)।",
      "source": {
        "board": "BB",
        "year": "2023",
        "qno": 22,
        "session": null
      },
      "tags": [],
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "higher_math_2nd-ch7-mcq-005",
      "text": "\\(\\sin\\theta + \\cos\\theta\\) এর বৃহত্তম মান কত?",
      "text_en": null,
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "a",
          "text": "\\(\\sqrt{2} + 1\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "b",
          "text": "\\(\\sqrt{2}\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "c",
          "text": "\\(1\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "d",
          "text": "\\(2\\)",
          "image": null
        }
      ],
      "answer": "b",
      "answer_source": "printed",
      "explanation": "\\(\\sin\\theta+\\cos\\theta=\\sqrt2\\sin\\left(\\theta+\\dfrac{\\pi}{4}\\right)\\)।\n\\(\\sin\\) এর সর্বোচ্চ মান 1, তাই বৃহত্তম মান \\(\\sqrt2\\)।",
      "source": {
        "board": "BB",
        "year": "2023",
        "qno": 23,
        "session": null
      },
      "tags": [],
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "higher_math_2nd-ch7-mcq-006",
      "text": "\\(\\sin 2\\theta - \\cos 2\\theta = 0\\) সমীকরণের সাধারণ সমাধান—",
      "text_en": null,
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "a",
          "text": "\\(\\dfrac{n\\pi}{2} + \\dfrac{\\pi}{4}\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "b",
          "text": "\\(\\dfrac{n\\pi}{2} - \\dfrac{\\pi}{4}\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "c",
          "text": "\\(\\dfrac{n\\pi}{2} - \\dfrac{\\pi}{8}\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "d",
          "text": "\\(\\dfrac{n\\pi}{2} + \\dfrac{\\pi}{8}\\)",
          "image": null
        }
      ],
      "answer": "d",
      "answer_source": "printed",
      "explanation": "\\(\\sin2\\theta=\\cos2\\theta\\) ⇒ \\(\\tan2\\theta=1=\\tan\\dfrac{\\pi}{4}\\)।\n\\(2\\theta=n\\pi+\\dfrac{\\pi}{4}\\) ⇒ \\(\\theta=\\dfrac{n\\pi}{2}+\\dfrac{\\pi}{8}\\)।",
      "source": {
        "board": "CB",
        "year": "2023",
        "qno": 5,
        "session": null
      },
      "tags": [],
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "higher_math_2nd-ch7-mcq-007",
      "text": "\\(\\cos^{-1}\\left(\\dfrac{2}{3}\\right)\\) এর মান হলো—",
      "text_en": null,
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "a",
          "text": "\\(\\tan^{-1}\\dfrac{\\sqrt{5}}{2}\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "b",
          "text": "\\(\\sin^{-1}\\dfrac{3}{2}\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "c",
          "text": "\\(\\sec^{-1}\\dfrac{2}{3}\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "d",
          "text": "\\(\\cot^{-1}\\dfrac{\\sqrt{5}}{3}\\)",
          "image": null
        }
      ],
      "answer": "a",
      "answer_source": "printed",
      "explanation": "\\(\\cos\\theta=\\dfrac23\\) ধরলে \\(\\sin\\theta=\\sqrt{1-\\dfrac49}=\\dfrac{\\sqrt5}{3}\\)।\n\\(\\tan\\theta=\\dfrac{\\sqrt5/3}{2/3}=\\dfrac{\\sqrt5}{2}\\) ⇒ \\(\\theta=\\tan^{-1}\\dfrac{\\sqrt5}{2}\\)।",
      "source": {
        "board": "CB",
        "year": "2023",
        "qno": 12,
        "session": null
      },
      "tags": [],
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "higher_math_2nd-ch7-mcq-008",
      "text": "\\(\\tan^{-1}\\dfrac{3}{4}\\) এর মান কোনটি?",
      "text_en": null,
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "a",
          "text": "\\(\\dfrac{1}{2}\\tan^{-1}\\dfrac{24}{25}\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "b",
          "text": "\\(\\dfrac{1}{2}\\sin^{-1}\\dfrac{24}{25}\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "c",
          "text": "\\(\\dfrac{1}{2}\\sin^{-1}\\dfrac{24}{7}\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "d",
          "text": "\\(\\dfrac{1}{2}\\tan^{-1}\\dfrac{7}{24}\\)",
          "image": null
        }
      ],
      "answer": "b",
      "answer_source": "printed",
      "explanation": "\\(\\tan^{-1}\\dfrac34=\\theta\\) ধরি। \\(\\sin2\\theta=\\dfrac{2\\tan\\theta}{1+\\tan^2\\theta}=\\dfrac{3/2}{25/16}=\\dfrac{24}{25}\\)।\nঅতএব \\(\\theta=\\dfrac12\\sin^{-1}\\dfrac{24}{25}\\)।",
      "source": {
        "board": "CB",
        "year": "2023",
        "qno": 16,
        "session": null
      },
      "tags": [],
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "higher_math_2nd-ch7-mcq-009",
      "text": "\\(\\sin\\left(x - \\dfrac{3\\pi}{2}\\right) = 0,\\ n \\in \\mathbb{Z}\\) এর সমাধান কোনটি?",
      "text_en": null,
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "a",
          "text": "\\(2n\\pi + \\dfrac{3\\pi}{2}\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "b",
          "text": "\\(2n\\pi - \\dfrac{3\\pi}{2}\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "c",
          "text": "\\(n\\pi - \\dfrac{3\\pi}{2}\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "d",
          "text": "\\(n\\pi + \\dfrac{3\\pi}{2}\\)",
          "image": null
        }
      ],
      "answer": "d",
      "answer_source": "printed",
      "explanation": "\\(\\sin A=0\\) ⇒ \\(A=n\\pi\\)।\n\\(x-\\dfrac{3\\pi}{2}=n\\pi\\) ⇒ \\(x=n\\pi+\\dfrac{3\\pi}{2}\\)।",
      "source": {
        "board": "CB",
        "year": "2023",
        "qno": 17,
        "session": null
      },
      "tags": [],
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "higher_math_2nd-ch7-mcq-010",
      "text": "\\(\\cos^2\\left(\\tan^{-1}\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\right)\\) এর মান কত?",
      "text_en": null,
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "a",
          "text": "\\(\\dfrac{2}{3}\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "b",
          "text": "\\(\\dfrac{3}{4}\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "c",
          "text": "\\(\\dfrac{4}{3}\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "d",
          "text": "\\(\\dfrac{3}{2}\\)",
          "image": null
        }
      ],
      "answer": "a",
      "answer_source": "printed",
      "explanation": "\\(\\theta=\\tan^{-1}\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt2}\\) ⇒ \\(\\tan\\theta=\\dfrac1{\\sqrt2}\\)।\n\\(\\cos^2\\theta=\\dfrac{1}{1+\\tan^2\\theta}=\\dfrac{1}{1+\\frac12}=\\dfrac23\\)।",
      "source": {
        "board": "CUB",
        "year": "2023",
        "qno": 2,
        "session": null
      },
      "tags": [],
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "higher_math_2nd-ch7-mcq-011",
