    {
      "id": "higher_math_2nd-ch7-mcq-012",
      "text": "\\(\\operatorname{cosec}\\theta + \\cot\\theta = \\sqrt{3}\\ (0 < \\theta < \\pi)\\) হলে, θ এর মান কত?",
      "text_en": null,
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "a",
          "text": "\\(\\dfrac{\\pi}{6}\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "b",
          "text": "\\(\\dfrac{\\pi}{4}\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "c",
          "text": "\\(\\dfrac{\\pi}{3}\\)",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "d",
          "text": "\\(\\dfrac{2\\pi}{3}\\)",
          "image": null
        }
      ],
      "answer": "c",
      "answer_source": "printed",
      "explanation": "\\(\\operatorname{cosec}\\theta+\\cot\\theta=\\dfrac{1+\\cos\\theta}{\\sin\\theta}=\\cot\\dfrac{\\theta}{2}\\)।\n\\(\\cot\\dfrac\\theta2=\\sqrt3\\) ⇒ \\(\\dfrac\\theta2=\\dfrac\\pi6\\) ⇒ \\(\\theta=\\dfrac\\pi3\\)।",
      "source": {
        "board": "CUB",
        "year": "2023",
        "qno": 13,
        "session": null
      },
      "tags": [],
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "higher_math_2nd-ch7-mcq-013",
      "text": "n একটি পূর্ণ সংখ্যা হলে \\(\\sin 2\\theta = 1\\) সমীকরণের সাধারণ সমাধান কোনটি?",
